---
import Module6Behold from './Module6Behold';
import Module6Derive from './Module6Derive';
import Module6Operate from './Module6Operate';
import Module6Prompts from './Module6Prompts';
---

<div class="m m6">
  <section class="m-block m6-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">behold</p>
    <p>
      Inside the diatonic walls, chromaticism is the act of momentarily
      stepping outside. The simplest move is the <em>secondary
      dominant</em>: pick any chord in the key, build its own dominant
      in front of it, and you've borrowed the leading-tone of another
      key for one chord only. Watch the V/V slip into a I–V–I and
      pull the V more strongly toward home.
    </p>
    <Module6Behold client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m6-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">derive</p>
    <p>
      Two main vocabularies live here. <strong>Secondary dominants</strong>{' '}
      (V/V, V/vi, V/ii…) tonicize any non-tonic chord — borrowing its
      leading-tone for one chord. <strong>Modal mixture</strong>{' '}
      borrows chords from the parallel minor (iv, ♭VI, ♭VII), injecting
      darker color without leaving the key proper. The <em>Neapolitan
      sixth</em> is a special predominant — ♭II in first inversion —
      sitting at the boundary between the two.
    </p>
    <Module6Derive client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m6-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">operate</p>
    <p>
      Switch between four four-chord progressions to A/B the same
      diatonic spine against three chromatic deviations. The chord
      slots glow as each one rings; the caption underneath spells out
      what borrowed motion you just heard.
    </p>
    <Module6Operate client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m6-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">prompt</p>
    <p class="m-prompt-intro">
      One vocabulary card, one ear card.
    </p>
    <Module6Prompts client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m6-block m-bridge m6-bridge">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">bridge</p>
    <p>
      Chromaticism still anchors to a key. The neo-Riemannian view
      drops the key entirely and asks: what's the shortest path from
      one triad to another, regardless of where you started? Next:
      <em>P, L, R</em> on the Tonnetz.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

<style is:global>
  /* Module 6 specific rules. */

  /* Behold ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m6-behold {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    max-width: 360px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .m6-behold-staff {
    background: #f5efe0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.4rem;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .m6-behold-staff.chromatic {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--accent);
  }
  .m6-behold-staff svg {
    display: block;
  }
  .m6-behold-track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .m6-behold-step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 3rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.55rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    opacity: 0.45;
    transition:
      opacity 0.25s ease,
      border-color 0.25s ease,
      background 0.25s ease;
  }
  .m6-behold-step.active {
    opacity: 1;
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.1);
  }
  .m6-behold-step.chromatic .m6-step-label {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .m6-step-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .m6-behold-caption {
    font-size: 0.9rem !important;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
    max-width: 38ch;
  }

  /* Derive ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m6-derive {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m6-chord-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 540px;
  }
  .m6-chord-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }
  .m6-chord-origin {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .m6-chord-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    align-items: stretch;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .m6-chord-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.55rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m6-chord-btn:hover:not(.active) {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m6-chord-btn.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m6-derive-staff {
    background: #f5efe0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.4rem;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .m6-derive-staff svg {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .m6-derive-caption {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
    max-width: 50ch;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
  }
  .m6-derive-caption strong {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Operate --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m6-operate {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m6-prog-picker {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 360px;
  }
  .m6-prog-btn {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m6-prog-btn:hover:not(.active):not(:disabled) {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m6-prog-btn.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m6-prog-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .m6-prog-display {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }
  .m6-prog-step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 3.4rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition:
      background 0.2s ease,
      border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .m6-prog-step.ringing {
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.12);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m6-prog-roman {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m6-operate-play {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .m6-operate-play:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m6-operate-play:disabled {
    cursor: default;
    background: var(--bg-button);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    border-color: var(--border);
  }
  .m6-operate-caption {
    font-size: 0.92rem !important;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 46ch;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .m6-chord-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
